PLACEHOLDER — NO LICENCE IS GRANTED YET
=======================================

This repository is a work in progress being prepared as the code-availability
deposit for a forthcoming publication. It is **private** and, until the file
below is replaced, no rights to use, copy, modify or redistribute it are
granted to anyone.

The licence is pending an institutional software-release determination
(Oak Ridge National Laboratory / UT-Battelle, LLC). When that determination is
made, this file must be replaced in full by the approved licence text together
with any required copyright and funding notices, BEFORE the repository is made
public.

Do not make this repository public while this placeholder is still here.
An unlicensed public repository is "all rights reserved" by default, which
would leave a reader unable to legally run or reuse the code the paper points
them at — the opposite of what a code-availability deposit is for.
